<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body style="height:auto;
			 min-height:auto;
			 margin:0;
			 padding:0;
			 background-color:#ffffff;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;
			  border-collapse:collapse;
			  background-color:#ffffff;">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td align="center" style="padding:0;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:760px;
							  width:100%;
							  background-color:#ffffff;
							  border:2px solid #c9a75d;
							  border-collapse:collapse;">
       <!-- Banner -->
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:0;"><img alt="Arelia Email Banner Image" src="{[devName:Arelia_Email_Banner_Image]}" title="Arelia Email Banner Image" style="display:block;
											width:100%;
											max-width:100%;
											height:auto;
											border:0;" /></td>
        </tr> <!-- Main Email Content -->
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:30px 34px 32px 34px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Dear <strong>{{{Case.Project_Client_Name__c}}}</strong>,</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Thank you for contacting <strong>Arelia</strong>.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">We would like to confirm that the support case you recently raised regarding your project <strong>{{{Case.Project__c}}}</strong> has been successfully registered in our system.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Your assigned Project Supervisor has been notified and will review the issue at the earliest opportunity to help ensure a timely resolution.</p> <!-- What Happens Next -->
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;
											  margin-bottom:18px;">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="border-top:1px solid #e3d2a8;
													   padding-top:20px;"><p style="margin:0;
														  font-size:20px;
														  line-height:1.4;
														  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
														  color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>What happens next?</strong></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <ul style="margin-top:8px;
										   margin-bottom:24px;
										   padding-left:24px;">
           <li style="margin-bottom:12px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;">Your Project Supervisor will review the case details and assess the appropriate next steps.</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:12px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;">You will be contacted if any additional information or clarification is required.</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:12px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;">Our team will work toward resolving your concern and keeping you informed of the progress.</li>
          </ul> <!-- Need Further Assistance -->
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;
											  margin-bottom:18px;">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="border-top:1px solid #e3d2a8;
													   padding-top:20px;"><p style="margin:0;
														  font-size:20px;
														  line-height:1.4;
														  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
														  color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>Need Further Assistance?</strong></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">If you have any additional information to share or require further assistance, please feel free to contact your Project Supervisor directly.</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;
											  margin:0 0 24px 0;">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="background-color:#fbf8f1;
													   border:1px solid #e3d2a8;
													   padding:14px 16px;"><p style="margin:0;
														  font-size:18px;
														  line-height:1.5;
														  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
														  color:#222222;"><strong>Supervisor Email:</strong>&nbsp;{{{Case.Supervisor_Email__c}}}</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Thank you for your time and patience. We are committed to providing prompt support and ensuring a smooth project experience.</p> <p style="margin:0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Warm regards,<br /> <strong>Team Arelia</strong></p></td>
        </tr> <!-- Short Professional Footer -->
        <tr>
         <td align="center" style="background-color:#171717;
									   border-top:2px solid #C99A3D;
									   padding:24px 32px 22px 32px;
									   text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
										  font-size:24px;
										  line-height:1.3;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#D6B36A;
										  font-weight:bold;
										  text-align:center;">Arelia</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:11px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
										  color:#C99A3D;
										  letter-spacing:2px;
										  text-align:center;">PREMIUM &amp; LUXURY INTERIOR DESIGNS</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td align="center" style="border-top:1px solid #6E5427;
													   padding-top:16px;
													   text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
														  font-size:11px;
														  line-height:1.6;
														  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
														  color:#8F887F;
														  text-align:center;">This email was sent to confirm that your support case has been successfully registered.</p> <p style="margin:0;
														  font-size:11px;
														  line-height:1.6;
														  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
														  color:#8F887F;
														  text-align:center;">© 2026 Arelia. All rights reserved.</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table></td>
        </tr>
       </tbody>
      </table></td>
    </tr>
   </tbody>
  </table>
 </body>
</html>